  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Anlitande av konsult f&#xf6;r avgr&#xe4;nsade uppdrag att utg&#xf6;ra st&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r enheten under tiden oktober-december 2004 (Maria Gasch).  Arbetsuppgifterna kommer framf&#xf6;r allt att innefatta tre omr&#xe5;den: utv&#xe4;rderingar, avsluta och arkivera handlingar inf&#xf6;r det nya e-doc-systemet samt genomf&#xf6;ra en kartl&#xe4;ggning av enhetens kommunikationsplan.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To contract a consultant for specific tasks during October - December 2004 (Maria Gasch). The consultant will be charged with the following three areas: Evaluations, complete contribution acts and archive documents before Sida&#xb4;s new e-doc system will start and finally make a survey of Culture &amp; Media Division&#xb4;s Plan of Communication.</narrative>
  </description>
